   "title": "当前做法与问题",
   "html": "<div class='callout'><p><b>专业问题：</b>单项化探异常可能来自地表污染而非油气线索。</p><p><b>输入资料：</b>C1、ΔC、酸解烃与采样位置。</p><p><b>服务目标：</b>区分联合异常与单指标污染，形成待查靶区。</p></div><svg viewBox='0 0 720 250' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='油气微渗漏原理与单指标阈值法的干扰'><text x='20' y='22' font-size='11' font-weight='600' fill='#202b38'>油气微渗漏：地下油藏在地面留下的「指纹」</text><line x1='20' y1='88' x2='340' y2='88' stroke='#52627a' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='26' y='80' font-size='9' fill='#52627a'>地表 · 采样网格</text><ellipse cx='180' cy='66' rx='85' ry='11' fill='#b05a51' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#b05a51' stroke-dasharray='4 3'/><text x='180' y='50' font-size='9' fill='#b05a51' text-anchor='middle'>环状 / 帽状化探异常</text><path d='M150,178 C146,150 152,120 146,92' fill='none' stroke='#d47a3a' stroke-width='1.3' stroke-dasharray='3 3' marker-end='url(#g2a1)'/><path d='M180,172 C184,144 178,116 182,88' fill='none' stroke='#d47a3a' stroke-width='1.3' stroke-dasharray='3 3' marker-end='url(#g2a1)'/><path d='M210,178 C214,150 208,120 214,92' fill='none' stroke='#d47a3a' stroke-width='1.3' stroke-dasharray='3 3' marker-end='url(#g2a1)'/><path d='M120,168 Q180,146 240,168' fill='none' stroke='#52627a' stroke-width='2'/><text x='248' y='160' font-size='9' fill='#52627a'>盖层</text><ellipse cx='180' cy='192' rx='58' ry='20' fill='#41699b' fill-opacity='.3' stroke='#41699b' stroke-width='1.4'/><text x='180' y='196' font-size='9.5' fill='#41699b' text-anchor='middle'>油气藏</text><text x='104' y='132' font-size='9' fill='#d47a3a'>微渗漏柱</text><text x='268' y='106' font-size='9' fill='#52627a'>土壤采样点</text><text x='20' y='240' font-size='9' fill='#64748b'>指标：吸附烃、酸解烃、ΔC……在油气藏正上方组合成环，单点高值说明不了问题</text><line x1='360' y1='14' x2='360' y2='236' stroke='#dfe6f0'/><defs><marker id='g2a1' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' refX='5' refY='3.5' orient='auto'><path d='M0,0 L7,3.5 L0,7 Z' fill='#d47a3a'/></marker></defs><text x='380' y='22' font-size='11' font-weight='600' fill='#202b38'>单指标阈值法：被地表污染带骗过</text><rect x='380' y='36' width='320' height='162' fill='#f4f8fd' stroke='#c9d4e4'/><path d='M380,120 C430,90 470,150 520,110 S600,80 700,120' fill='none' stroke='#d47a3a' stroke-width='14' stroke-opacity='.2'/><path d='M380,120 C430,90 470,150 520,110 S600,80 700,120' fill='none' stroke='#d47a3a' stroke-width='1' stroke-opacity='.55'/><text x='560' y='92' font-size='9' fill='#d47a3a'>河流污染带</text><ellipse cx='455' cy='62' rx='40' ry='24' fill='none' stroke='#2875c7' stroke-width='1.3' stroke-dasharray='5 3'/><circle cx='455' cy='42' r='3' fill='#2875c7' fill-opacity='.85'/><circle cx='482' cy='54' r='3' fill='#2875c7' fill-opacity='.85'/><circle cx='488' cy='76' r='3' fill='#2875c7' fill-opacity='.85'/><circle cx='455' cy='84' r='3' fill='#2875c7' fill-opacity='.85'/><circle cx='428' cy='72' r='3' fill='#2875c7' fill-opacity='.85'/><circle cx='430' cy='50' r='3' fill='#2875c7' fill-opacity='.85'/><text transform=\"translate(0 24)\" x='455' y='28' font-size='9' fill='#2875c7' text-anchor='middle'>真实组合异常</text><ellipse cx='590' cy='112' rx='62' ry='30' fill='none' stroke='#b05a51' stroke-width='1.3' stroke-dasharray='5 3'/><circle cx='560' cy='102' r='3' fill='#b05a51' fill-opacity='.85'/><circle cx='596' cy='96' r='3' fill='#b05a51' fill-opacity='.85'/><circle cx='622' cy='118' r='3' fill='#b05a51' fill-opacity='.85'/><circle cx='582' cy='128' r='3' fill='#b05a51' fill-opacity='.85'/><circle cx='636' cy='102' r='3' fill='#b05a51' fill-opacity='.85'/><text x='590' y='152' font-size='9' fill='#b05a51' text-anchor='middle'>被阈值法误圈的「异常」</text><text x='380' y='240' font-size='9' fill='#64748b'>吸附烃单项高值 ≠ 油气异常：地表污染、地形与季节都能抬高单项指标</text></svg><div class='figcap'><b>专业原理示意</b><span>用于解释业务概念和空间、参数关系；图中数字与对照为教学示意，不是现场成果。</span></div>"
